{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/524070-tooth-and-claw","id":524070,"title":"Tooth and Claw","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-21T23:50:49-07:00","id":524070,"title":"Tooth and Claw","content":"I'm a bit confused. On page 186 of WtF 2Ed, under the title Tooth and Claw, it talks about how werewolves can deal devestating damage to a weaker spirit because of their Rank. Ok, makes sense. But then it says that a high ranking spirit can't damage a Uratha in turn just by touching it. So is this implying that spirits can't hurt Uratha at all directly? Because I thought that spirits could inflict damage on a Uratha? Did I miss something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T23:52:51-07:00","id":524090,"title":"","content":"They have to do it the hard way. No counting as banes for them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T00:10:57-07:00","id":524136,"title":"","content":"Awesome, thanks for clearing that up. I had skimmed over the part about high ranking spirits being the bane of lower ranking spirits, so I was reading it out of context.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T02:30:57-07:00","id":524190,"title":"","content":"Yeah. Just so everybody's on the same page here, every spirit has banes that, if exploited, does agg damage to that spirit. Higher ranking spirits can attack lower ranked spirits like they were exploiting a ban; Uratha get an honorary spirit rank that allows them to deal agg to lower ranked spirits but explicitly -doesn't- count for allowing higher ranked spirits to deal agg to the Uratha.<br /> <br /> TL;DR spirit hierarchy gives you the ability to kill your lessers easier, and werewolves get the perks without the drawbacks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T20:27:34-07:00","id":525039,"title":"","content":"That being said, most werewolves would appreciate having their pack around when facing a high level spirit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T22:42:02-07:00","id":525158,"title":"","content":"All the more reason why werewolves are BOSS! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-23T00:04:38-07:00","id":525194,"title":"","content":"FYI this is what Predator's Claim affects. It makes it so the bane thing works against stuff of your (real) rank instead of your rank - 2.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}